From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dodaskot <pessdres@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 21:46:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 067/131] power: supply: add MT6359 fuel gauge; use it on a22x

Read the FGADC coulomb counter of the MT6359 PMIC (left running by the
bootloader): instantaneous current and the charge counter. The state of
charge is taken from the OCV table at probe (terminal voltage corrected
by I*R) and then follows the counter, also across suspend. A full
charge re-anchors it to 100 %, near empty it is pulled towards the OCV
estimate. Replaces the voltage-only adc-battery on a22x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
